inejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-line/60 py-4 px-2 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/50 hover:text-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20 focus:bg-surface/50 last:border-b-0\" href=\"/companies/jallal-properties-group\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.384-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink truncate\">Jallal Properties Group</span><span class=\"text-label-sm text-muted truncate\">Real estate, land diligence and commercial property</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line pt-4\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">View all subsidiaries</span><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/companies\">Explore portfolio<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><a class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/digital-ventures\">Digital Ventures</a></div><div class=\"relative\"><a class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2 py-2 transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/partnerships\">Partnerships</a></div></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-ink text-white hover:bg-forest shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-9 px-4 hidden sm:inline-flex btn-press\" href=\"/partnerships#inquiry\">Partner with us</a><a title=\"Team login\" aria-label=\"Team login\" class=\"hidden h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-white transition-colors hover:bg-forest sm:flex focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20\" href=\"/admin/login\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-line text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-sunken lg:hidden focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"flex-1 pt-20\"><section class=\"border-b border-line bg-white\"><div class=\"page-container py-12 lg:py-16\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-label-sm text-muted\"><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-ink\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span class=\"text-ink\">Privacy policy</span></nav><div class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl\"><span class=\"label-caps text-accent\">Legal</span><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-ink\">Privacy policy</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-muted\">This policy describes how Jallal Group handles personal information submitted through our corporate website.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-sm text-muted\">Last reviewed: November 2026.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-surface py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">1. Who we are</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Jallal Group (Jallal Group) is a business group registered and operating from Bo, Sierra Leone. This policy explains how we handle personal information collected through https://jallalgroup.workers.dev/.</p><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">For any question about this policy, contact us at the email address listed at the end of this page.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">2. Information we collect</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We collect information you provide voluntarily when you submit a partnership inquiry or request venture updates: your name, organisation, email address, phone number, the partnership category you select and the content of your message.</p><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We also record limited technical data for abuse prevention, such as a hashed network address and browser string. We do not store raw IP addresses.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">3. How we use your information</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We use submitted information to review, route and respond to your inquiry; to maintain a record of institutional dialogue; and to send the specific updates you requested.</p><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We do not sell personal information, we do not share it with advertisers, and we do not use it for unrelated marketing.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">4. Legal basis</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Where data protection law applies, we process inquiry data on the basis of your consent (given when you submit the form) and our legitimate interest in responding to genuine business correspondence.</p><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">You may withdraw consent at any time by contacting us; we will then delete the inquiry record unless we are required to retain it.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">5. Storage and retention</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Inquiry records are stored in a managed cloud database provided by Appwrite, with access restricted to authorised Jallal Group personnel through server-side controls. Database permissions prevent public access to inquiry data.</p><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We retain inquiries for as long as they remain relevant to an active or prospective engagement, and review retention periodically. Records are deleted when they are no longer needed.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">6. Cookies</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">This website does not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. A strictly necessary session cookie is used only to keep authorised administrators signed in to the private dashboard.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">7. Your rights</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">You may request access to the personal information we hold about you, request correction or deletion, or object to processing. We will respond to verified requests within a reasonable period.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">8. Security</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We apply access controls, encryption in transit, least-privilege server credentials and rate limiting on public forms. No system is completely secure, but we review our safeguards as the platform evolves.</p></div></article><article class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">9. Changes to this policy</h2><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal obligations. The current version is always published at this address with its revision date.</p></div></article><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Contact</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Privacy requests can be sent to<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:partnerships@jallalgroup.com\" class=\"font-semibold text-ink underline underline-offset-2\">partnerships@jallalgroup.com</a> <!-- -->or by post to our headquarters in <!-- -->Bo, Sierra Leone<!-- -->.</p></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-forest text-white\"><div class=\"page-container pb-8 pt-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Jallal Group\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-16 object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75\"/></a><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0\" style=\"transition-delay:0s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0s, transform 0s ease-out 0s\"><p class=\"max-w-sm text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">A diversified, technology-driven business group building companies, digital platforms and innovative solutions for emerging markets across Sierra Leone and beyond.</p></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-