he form) and our legitimate interest in responding to genuine business correspondence.\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"You may withdraw consent at any \",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"You may withdraw consent at any time by contacting us; we will then delete the inquiry record unless we are required to retain it.\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"article\",\"5. Storage and retention\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"5. Storage and retention\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Inquiry records are stored in a \",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Inquiry records are stored in a managed cloud database provided by Appwrite, with access restricted to authorised Jallal Group personnel through server-side controls. Database permissions prevent public access to inquiry data.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"We retain inquiries for as long \",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"We retain inquiries for as long as they remain relevant to an active or prospective engagement, and review retention periodically. Records are deleted when they are no longer needed.\"}]]}]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"article\",\"6. Cookies\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"6. Cookies\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"This website does not use advert\",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"This website does not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. A strictly necessary session cookie is used only to keep authorised administrators signed in to the private dashboard.\"}]]}]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"article\",\"7. Your rights\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"cla