xt-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Jallal Group (Jallal Group) is a business group registered and operating from Bo, Sierra Leone. This policy explains how we handle personal information collected through https://jallalgroup.workers.dev/.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"For any question about this poli\",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"For any question about this policy, contact us at the email address listed at the end of this page.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"2. Information we collect\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"2. Information we collect\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"We collect information you provi\",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"We collect information you provide voluntarily when you submit a partnership inquiry or request venture updates: your name, organisation, email address, phone number, the partnership category you select and the content of your message.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"We also record limited technical\",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"We also record limited technical data for abuse prevention, such as a hashed network address and browser string. We do not store raw IP addresses.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"3. How we use your information\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"3. How we use your information\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"We use submitted information to \",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"We use submitted information to review, route and respond to your inquiry; to maintain a record of institutional dialogue; and to send the specific update