equest access to the personal information we hold about you, request correction or deletion, or object to processing. We will respond to verified requests within a reasonable period.\"}]]}]]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"article\",\"8. Security\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"8. Security\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"We apply access controls, encryp\",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"We apply access controls, encryption in transit, least-privilege server credentials and rate limiting on public forms. No system is completely secure, but we review our safeguards as the platform evolves.\"}]]}]]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"article\",\"9. Changes to this policy\",{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"9. Changes to this policy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"We may update this policy to ref\",{\"className\":\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal obligations. The current version is always published at this address with its revision date.\"}]]}]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Contact\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":[\"Privacy requests can be sent to\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:partnerships@jallalgroup.com\",\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink underline underline-offset-2\",\"children\":\"partnerships@jallalgroup.com\"}],\" \",\"or by post to our headquarters in \",\"Bo, Sierra Leone\",\".\"]}]]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1a\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@20\"}]}]\n1e:true\na:300\n20:null\na:C\n1d:0\n8:\"$undefined\"\n1c:\"$undefined\"\n15:\"$undefined\"\n"}}